        "notes": [
          {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in chromium-browser. An out-of-bounds write vulnerability exists within the ANGLE graphics component, allowing a remote attacker to trigger out-of-bounds memory access by providing a specially crafted HTML page. This allows an attacker to potentially manipulate memory contents. The vulnerability is triggered by processing malicious graphics instructions. This can lead to unexpected program behavior.",
