            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in ANGLE, a component used in chromium-browser. A remote attacker could exploit an out-of-bounds write vulnerability by enticing a user to visit a specially crafted HTML page. This could potentially lead to the execution of arbitrary code outside of the browser's security sandbox, allowing the attacker to gain control over the affected system.",
